        "Task 2.9: recoded from CPT 38206 to SNOMED 127788007 (Apheresis),",
        "the closest verified SNOMED concept for peripheral blood stem",
        "cell collection (performed via leukapheresis prior to autologous",
        "transplant). CPT 38206 preserved as the HCPCS billing mapping in",
        "export/hcpcs_code_map.json (new row added in this commit)."
