    "CRAB_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Task 2.9 (audit 2026-08-10): complication rates converted from the",
        "old flat per-visit values (10%/8%/5%, compounding to an absurd",
        "cumulative complication burden since CRAB_Check re-rolls every",
        "monitoring pass) to annual incidence, per-pass-converted against",
        "the Stable_MM monitoring interval (1-3 months, avg 2mo = 1/6 yr):",
        "CKD 3%/yr -> 1-(0.97)^(1/6) = 0.005063670756198957;",
        "fracture 8%/yr -> 1-(0.92)^(1/6) = 0.013800818181815777;",
        "hypercalcemia 4%/yr -> 1-(0.96)^(1/6) = 0.006780573220505293.",
        "Sources: SEER Cancer Stat Facts: Myeloma (seer.cancer.gov) for MM",
        "epidemiology; Kyle RA et al. 'Review of 1027 patients with newly",
        "diagnosed multiple myeloma.' Mayo Clin Proc. 2003;78(1):21-33 for",
        "CRAB feature prevalence used to bound the relative complication",
        "mix. Each complication is now attribute-guarded (mm_ckd/",
        "mm_fracture/mm_hypercalcemia, set via assign_to_attribute on the",
        "matching ConditionOnset) via the *_Check states below, so an",
        "already-diagnosed complication does not stack/re-onset on later",
        "passes -- it falls through to the stable close instead. Anemia's",
        "0.12 is unchanged (it is not a persisting ConditionOnset -- it",
        "just picks a treatment modality each pass, so 'no stacking' does",
        "not apply the same way) and 'CRAB_Check_Encounter_End' (stable",
        "pass, no new complication) absorbs the remaining probability."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "CRAB_Check_Encounter_End",
          "distribution": 0.85435493784148
        },
        {
          "transition": "Anemia",
          "distribution": 0.12
        },
        {
          "transition": "Renal_Failure_Check",
          "distribution": 0.005063670756198957
        },
        {
          "transition": "Bone_Disease_Check",
          "distribution": 0.013800818181815777
        },
        {
          "transition": "Hypercalcemia_Check",
          "distribution": 0.006780573220505293
        }
      ]
    },
    "Renal_Failure_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
